# k.parts/shards/r: the usual parts of 24 common things whose name starts with "r" (rabbit, racehorse, radar, rail, railing, railway ...): the parts WordNet gives the thing, and the parts it gives what the thing is a kind of.
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (Princeton WordNet 3.1: part meronyms, hypernyms, glosses); which words are common things: tools/coverage.mjs (frequency-words 2018, wordnet 3.1)
